//---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Function: powm
// A recursive integer exponentiation routine in which we insert a few
// SVE “dummy” vector operations (using Z0‐, P0‐ registers, addvl, rdvl,
// cntd, and, lsl, ptrue, index, mls, ld1d, movprfx, st1d) to illustrate the
