Explanation of the key changes:
1. In the second loop the equality compare now writes its result into predicate p7 (instead of p8) and the subsequent count uses p7.
2. In the dummy SVE operations ptrue now produces a full–mask in predicate register p2 (instead of the out–of–range p9). The instructions cnth, rev, splice, uaddv, and lastb have been changed to use p2.
3. The immediate constant 0xff is now loaded via “mov x16, #0xff” and then duplicated with “dup z15.d, x16” (since 0xff is not directly representable as an immediate in dup).

This version should compile and link correctly on an aarch64+SVE2 target.

